### 50. Persistence: after restarting the app, re-run only this request (it uses the saved bookingId) -> 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings/{{bookingId}}

> {%
    client.test("booking still exists after restart", () => {
        client.assert(response.status === 200, "got " + response.status);
        client.assert(response.body.status === "Cancelled", "got " + response.body.status);
    });
%}
